$var wire 1 A# pixel_clk $end
$var wire 1 (* rst_n $end
$var wire 1 2, enable $end
$var wire 1 s* hcount [11] $end
$var wire 1 t* hcount [10] $end
$var wire 1 u* hcount [9] $end
$var wire 1 v* hcount [8] $end
$var wire 1 w* hcount [7] $end
